  {
   "text": "Trembling took hold of them there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Anguish like a woman in labor",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With an east wind you shattered the ships",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We heard it and now we see",
